577-## Best Practices
578-
579-- **Use preconditions for agent instructions** — attach design docs, specs, or step-by-step instructions before spawning
580:- **Use outcomes for work products** — research findings, analysis, implementation notes
581-- **Use explicit create/update/delete** — `add_resource` / `resource add` must not silently overwrite; use `update_resource` / `resource update` when replacing an existing payload
582-- **Use adopt only for local repair** — `resource adopt` registers bytes already stored at `.resources/<elementID>/<name>` without rewriting them; a missing payload returns resource-not-found and an existing declaration returns resource-exists
583-- **Use one safe filename component** — element IDs and resource names containing traversal segments, absolute paths, path separators, malformed URL escapes, or encoded/repeatedly encoded escapes are rejected in local and remote storage
584-- **Always use board commands** — never create/edit resource files or progress.md resource sections manually
