LOGBOOK.md-132-- FINDING: The pressure fixture waits only for the actor-side count to reach 64 while the admitted exit operations concurrently enter network progress and failure cleanup. A waiter can begin channel disposal before the above-cap probe is admitted, causing `beginChannelOperation` to prefer the disposal code `.cancelled` over the cap error. Rework must make the cap boundary deterministic without weakening the expected error, skipping the case, or masking it with timing.
